#. TRANSLATORS: command line argument
#: client/pkgc-manage.c:86
msgid "Maximum metadata cache age in seconds (default: 3 days)"
msgstr "Maksimal alder for hurtiglagring av metadata i sekund (standard: 3 dager)"

#: client/pkgc-manage.c:86
